{
  "name": "Customer Support Ticket Bot (Reference Solution)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Support Ticket Bot — Reference Solution\n\n**Flow:** Telegram Trigger → Extract fields → Empty-message check → Intent Switch (billing / technical / currency-API / general fallback) → each branch logs to Google Sheets and replies via Telegram.\n\n**Before running:**\n1. Add your Telegram Bot credential (from @BotFather) to the Trigger + all Telegram Send nodes.\n2. Add your Google Sheets credential + spreadsheet/sheet ID to all 4 'Log to Sheet' nodes.\n3. Replace `YOUR_ADMIN_CHAT_ID` in the admin-notify node.\n4. Activate the workflow so the Telegram webhook registers.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 620
      },
      "id": "81837009-936a-41da-920f-0a038b89ec99",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -32,
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "updates": [
          "message"
        ],
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "d38897b5-d315-4823-8bc5-25a22ff9cdff",
      "name": "Telegram Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        -32,
        400
      ],
      "webhookId": "support-bot-webhook",
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "1LaQJ6SPMTcnSAvu",
          "name": "Telegram account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a1",
              "name": "chatId",
              "type": "number",
              "value": "={{ $json.message.chat.id }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "a2",
              "name": "userId",
              "type": "number",
              "value": "={{ $json.message.from.id }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "a3",
              "name": "username",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.message.from.username || $json.message.from.first_name || 'unknown' }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "a4",
              "name": "messageText",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.message.text || '' }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "a5",
              "name": "messageTextLower",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ ($json.message.text || '').toLowerCase() }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "a6",
              "name": "timestamp",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $now.toISO() }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
